<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Serenity Candles - Handcrafted Aromatherapy</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background: #faf8f5;
        }

        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c1810 0%, #4a2c1f 100%);
            color: #f5e6d3;
            padding: 2rem 0;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        nav {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: #f5e6d3;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: #ffd89b;
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.3), rgba(0,0,0,0.3)), url('data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1200 600"><rect fill="%23d4a574" width="1200" height="600"/><circle cx="300" cy="150" r="80" fill="%23c89666" opacity="0.5"/><circle cx="900" cy="400" r="120" fill="%23c89666" opacity="0.5"/></svg>');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 8rem 2rem;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .cta-button {
            background: #d4a574;
            color: white;
            padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            background: #c89666;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            color: #2c1810;
        }

        .products {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .product-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        }

        .product-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        .product-image {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4a574 0%, #c89666 100%);
            height: 250px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 4rem;
        }

        .product-info {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .product-info h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: #2c1810;
        }

        .product-info p {
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .price {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: #d4a574;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .features {
            background: white;
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }

        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .feature {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        footer {
            background: #2c1810;
            color: #f5e6d3;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-top: 4rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }
            
            .nav-links {
                gap: 1rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <nav>
            <div class="logo">🕯️ Serenity Candles</div>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#products">Products</a></li>
                <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <h1>Illuminate Your Space</h1>
        <p>Handcrafted candles made with natural soy wax and essential oils</p>
        <a href="#products" class="cta-button">Shop Now</a>
    </section>

    <section class="features">
        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-icon">🌿</div>
                <h3>100% Natural</h3>
                <p>Made with pure soy wax and essential oils</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-icon">✋</div>
                <h3>Handcrafted</h3>
                <p>Each candle is carefully hand-poured with love</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-icon">🎨</div>
                <h3>Unique Scents</h3>
                <p>Curated fragrances for every mood</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container" id="products">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Collection</h2>
        <div class="products">
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="product-image">🕯️</div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <h3>Lavender Dreams</h3>
                    <p>Calming lavender with hints of vanilla. Perfect for relaxation and bedtime.</p>
                    <div class="price">$24.99</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="product-image">🕯️</div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <h3>Ocean Breeze</h3>
                    <p>Fresh coastal scent with sea salt and jasmine notes.</p>
                    <div class="price">$22.99</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="product-image">🕯️</div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <h3>Warm Amber</h3>
                    <p>Rich amber with sandalwood and musk. Creates a cozy atmosphere.</p>
                    <div class="price">$26.99</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="product-image">🕯️</div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <h3>Citrus Burst</h3>
                    <p>Energizing blend of orange, lemon, and grapefruit.</p>
                    <div class="price">$21.99</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="product-image">🕯️</div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <h3>Forest Pine</h3>
                    <p>Crisp pine and cedarwood for a woodland escape.</p>
                    <div class="price">$23.99</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="product-image">🕯️</div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <h3>Rose Garden</h3>
                    <p>Romantic rose petals with a touch of peony.</p>
                    <div class="price">$25.99</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer id="contact">
        <p>&copy; 2025 Serenity Candles. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>Email: hello@serenitycandles.com | Phone: (555) 123-4567</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
